#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:5
msgid "Add column to title block"
msgstr "在图框中添加列"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ allows adding `columns`_ from `menu bar`_"
" and `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 允许通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `绘图区 "
"<drawing area_>`_ 添加 `列 <columns_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:11
msgid "Add column from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏添加列"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Add a column** menu item to add a new `column`_ at the right"
" side from the `title block`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 添加列** 菜单项，在 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的右侧添加新的 `列 <column_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:22
msgid ""
"Adding a new `column`_ at the middle from the `title block`_ can only be "
"done from `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `图框 <title block_>`_ 中间添加新的 `列 <column_>`_ 只能通过 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 完成。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:26
msgid "Add column from drawing area"
msgstr "从绘图区添加列"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:28
msgid ""
"Right click on the head from the `column`_ next to the position where the "
"new `column`_ should be placed."
msgstr "在应放置新 `列 <column_>`_ 的位置旁边，右键单击 `列 <column_>`_ 的列头。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:29
msgid ""
"Click the option **Add a column (before)** or **Add a column (after)** to "
"add a new column before or after the selected `column`_."
msgstr "单击选项 **添加列（之前）** 或 **添加列（之后）** ，即可在选定 `列 <column_>`_ 之前或之后添加新列。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_add.rst:34
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, drawing area"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，绘图区"
